error: `lockAsync` lends the reader, and a call without `await` starts it as a task of its own, which a borrow cannot go to
  --> error_file_lock_unawaited.sg:4:19
 4 |     var waiting = file.lockAsync()
   |                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  hint: `await file.lockAsync()` runs it as part of this task, where it can borrow
